          {
            "title": "Return a clear signal",
            "id": 152119,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gib ein klares Signal zurück, wenn der Mengentext nicht konvertiert werden kann.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"quantity.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_quantity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(value)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>None</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Behandle nur Text, der keine gültige Ganzzahl ist, und gib ein Fehlersignal zurück, ohne einen Mengenwert zu erfinden.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"quantity.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_quantity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(value)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Exception\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>ValueError</code>, gefolgt von <code>None</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Check for None",
            "id": 152120,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Überprüfe das Ergebnis des Parsers, bevor du die Bestellung verarbeitest.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"quantity.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"quantity = parse_quantity(\" /><text value=\"&quot;many&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" quantity \" /><text value=\"is\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Skip order&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"== 0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>is None</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Übergib ungültigen Ganzzahltext und prüfe das Fehlersignal, damit der Aufrufer <code>Skip order</code> ausgibt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"quantity.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"quantity = parse_quantity(\" /><text value=\"&quot;many&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" quantity \" /><text value=\"is\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Skip order&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"== 0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"many\"</code>, gefolgt von <code>is None</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Choose the sentinel",
            "id": 152121,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Eine ungültige Menge bedeutet, dass die Bestellung nicht fortgesetzt werden kann. Welcher Rückgabewert macht dieses Fehlschlagen deutlich, ohne eine Menge zu erfinden?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return None</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>return 0</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>return 1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>return None</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Use zero deliberately",
            "id": 152122,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ungültiger Rabatttext bedeutet, dass kein Rabatt angewendet wird. Vervollständige den gültigen Standardwert.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"discount.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"read_discount\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(value)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"None\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>0</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
